# sovpa agent rules

Read and strictly follow `docs/AGENTS.md`. Also use `docs/architecture.md` and `docs/commands.md`.

This is a **Kotlin Multiplatform + Compose Multiplatform** project (Android + iOS). Architecture is still evolving — prefer small, safe changes. Do not assume Android-only patterns in `commonMain`.

## Critical rules

- No Android-only or iOS-only APIs in `commonMain`.
- Update all `expect`/`actual` implementations together.
- Do not add dependencies or change Kotlin/Compose/Gradle/AGP versions without confirmation.
- Versions only via `gradle/libs.versions.toml`.
- Prefer `./scripts/check-fast.sh` or targeted tasks; avoid `./gradlew build` and `clean` by default.
- After changes, run relevant tests and report results.
- If iOS cannot be built/tested here, mark iOS as unverified.
- Do not delete failing tests.
- Do not introduce heavy architecture changes without approval.
- Reference feature for full vertical slices: `feature-auth-api` / `feature-auth-impl`.
- Do not commit secrets, `local.properties`, keystores, or API keys.
- Do not add code comments or KDoc, even if nearby code has them; leave existing comments untouched unless asked.
